 "remarks": "Welcome to Redstone Manor in Stamford's desirable Glenbrook neighborhood! This spacious and inviting 1 bedroom condo offers a fantastic combination of comfort, convenience, and a rare outdoor amenity. Beautiful parquet hardwood floors flow through the generously sized living area, while a separate dining space provides plenty of room for entertaining or everyday meals. The kitchen features white cabinetry, ample counter space, a gas range, dishwasher, and stainless steel microwave. The spacious bedroom offers excellent storage, including a custom closet organization system. But what truly sets this unit apart is its rare direct access to the outdoor terrace, a feature available to only a select few units in the building! Enjoy the charm of this well maintained brick building, complete with a welcoming lobby and beautifully landscaped grounds. Conveniently located near shopping, dining, public transportation, downtown Stamford, and major commuting routes. If you're looking for a spacious one bedroom with a little something extra, this is one you won't want to miss!",
